<hgroup><h1>A cross-shaped combined ultrasound array patch for continuous bladder volume monitoring</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Li%20Z"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Ziqi Li</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
<h3><span class="name western">Ziqi Li</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>a</sup>School of Biomedical Engineering &amp; State Key Laboratory of Advanced Medical Materials and Devices, ShanghaiTech University, Shanghai, 201210, China</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Li%20Z"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Ziqi Li</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>a</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Pu%20C"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id2"><span class="name western">Cong Pu</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id2">
<h3><span class="name western">Cong Pu</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>a</sup>School of Biomedical Engineering &amp; State Key Laboratory of Advanced Medical Materials and Devices, ShanghaiTech University, Shanghai, 201210, China</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Pu%20C"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Cong Pu</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>a</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Zhang%20T"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id3"><span class="name western">Ting Zhang</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id3">
