<sup>b</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Peng%20C"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id4"><span class="name western">Chang Peng</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id4">
<h3><span class="name western">Chang Peng</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>a</sup>School of Biomedical Engineering &amp; State Key Laboratory of Advanced Medical Materials and Devices, ShanghaiTech University, Shanghai, 201210, China</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Peng%20C"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Chang Peng</span></a>
