<div class="d-panels font-secondary-light">
<div id="aip_a" class="d-panel p" style="display: none">
<div class="p" id="aff0005">
<sup>a</sup>School of Biomedical Engineering &amp; State Key Laboratory of Advanced Medical Materials and Devices, ShanghaiTech University, Shanghai, 201210, China</div>
<div id="aff0010">
<sup>b</sup>Department of Integrative Medicine, Huashan Hospital, Fudan University, Shanghai, China</div>
<div class="author-notes p"><div class="fn" id="cor1">
<sup>⁎</sup><p class="display-inline">Corresponding author. <span>pengchang@shanghaitech.edu.cn</span></p>
</div></div>
</div>
<div id="anp_a" class="d-panel p" style="display: none"><div class="notes p"><section id="historyarticle-meta1" class="history"><p>Received 2026 Apr 26; Revised 2026 Aug 31; Accepted 2026 Sep 10; Collection date 2026 Oct.</p></section></div></div>
<div id="clp_a" class="d-panel p" style="display: none">
<div>© 2026 The Authors</div>
